WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.643 --> 00:00:04.576
Imagine building an app that barely relies on traditional advertising…

2
00:00:04.832 --> 00:00:08.395
and Facebook offers nearly nineteen billion dollars to acquire it.

3
00:00:10.655 --> 00:00:11.843
Back in two thousand nine,

4
00:00:12.069 --> 00:00:14.974
Jan Koum and Brian Acton started with a simple idea:

5
00:00:15.375 --> 00:00:18.759
make communication easier, faster, and more affordable.

6
00:00:18.973 --> 00:00:19.822
No games.

7
00:00:20.036 --> 00:00:21.049
No news feed.

8
00:00:21.274 --> 00:00:23.257
No ads fighting for your attention.

9
00:00:23.459 --> 00:00:24.390
Just messages.

10
00:00:25.142 --> 00:00:27.797
By twenty fourteen, WhatsApp had reached four hundred and fifty

11
00:00:27.917 --> 00:00:30.366
million monthly users, and it was adding more than a

12
00:00:30.486 --> 00:00:32.492
million new users every day.

13
00:00:32.688 --> 00:00:34.081
In less than five years,

14
00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:37.377
it had become one of the most used communication tools on the planet.

15
00:00:41.643 --> 00:00:44.766
Then Facebook made a deal that shocked the technology world:

16
00:00:45.115 --> 00:00:48.701
approximately nineteen billion dollars in total announced value.

17
00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:50.877
Sixteen billion in cash and stock,

18
00:00:51.099 --> 00:00:53.782
plus three billion in employee stock awards.

19
00:00:54.027 --> 00:00:56.502
For a company with fewer than sixty employees.

20
00:00:58.101 --> 00:01:00.514
WhatsApp didn't need to become a complicated product.

21
00:01:00.703 --> 00:01:03.633
It solved a problem people experienced every single day.

22
00:01:03.845 --> 00:01:06.020
And when millions of people depend on your product,

23
00:01:06.198 --> 00:01:08.543
its value can become enormous.

24
00:01:08.743 --> 00:01:09.860
Not because of what it added.

25
00:01:10.072 --> 00:01:11.674
But because of what it refused to add.

26
00:01:14.392 --> 00:01:17.327
The next billion-dollar idea might not be complicated.

27
00:01:17.511 --> 00:01:20.859
It might be a simple solution to a problem everyone has.

28
00:01:21.078 --> 00:01:22.384
Have a problem worth solving?

29
00:01:22.603 --> 00:01:23.864
Let's build something useful.
